Technical design of DDRT:

BR table - On receiving a CB from bank, cb contains field known as br which tells that why the cb was raised.

For each bank -> BRs are different - This is challenge - since there are patterns and similarities in brs and wanted to do groupings in order to simplify, so expedia reason was created

For each BR -> a ER is allocated ( total 8 active )
Each of the BR -> is associated to a card type, 
since it could be possible that a bank supports multiple cards, so depends on which card the customer choose and when customer calls the bank, sees which card the customer has and on basis of that br is choosen by bank, 
also in dispute process, final say always lies with card
second cb is submitted by bank -> expedia still wants to fight the cb -> final say of card

onboard a new bank -> new bank reasons are provided by them

combination of br + card type is unique -> mapped to a erc


